WHATWG named character references
---------------------------------

The checked-in entities dataset and generated Swift lookup table are derived
from the WHATWG HTML Standard's named character references:

  Source: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/entities.json
  Retrieved: 2026-07-30 (Asia/Tokyo)
  Upstream HTTP Last-Modified: 2025-11-12 00:20:03 GMT
  SHA-256: d741d877ac77c4194c4ad526b5b4a19aef8dfe411ab840a466891cdbb9f362e6
  HTML Standard revision:
    https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/b94ff8886e9afdcc761fcb1565d1488976fa60ba

This is the latest revision before WHATWG commit
320c05f679e2e0795acde90d0704caf7ade03fdc added processing-instruction
tokens and states. Processing instructions are outside this package's pinned
public token model.

Copyright © WHATWG (Apple, Google, Mozilla, Microsoft).

The dataset is preserved verbatim in
Tools/GenerateNamedCharacterReferences/entities.json. Its representation is
converted deterministically into
Sources/HTMLICanSeeTokenizer/Generated/HTMLNamedCharacterReferences.swift.
